name=ADB Over Wi-Fi (Persistent, LAN-locked)
version=5.3
versionCode=9
author=Bastet
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nalbe/shark8-adb-wifi-lan-persistent/main/update.json
description=adbd TCP on 5555 from boot, firewalled to the live wlan0 subnet. A netlink watcher retargets the LAN rule on every Wi-Fi connect/disconnect, so debug ADB comes up exactly when Wi-Fi does. USB adb unaffected. No init changes, no overlays.